# SmarterEdu Website

Responsive static coaching website for SmarterEdu (LKG–12).

## Before publishing

Open `assets/config.js` and replace:
- `91XXXXXXXXXX` with the real WhatsApp number
- `+91 XXXXX XXXXX` with the real phone number
- `hello@smarteredu.in` with the preferred email

## Included sections

- Home
- About
- Courses (LKG–12)
- Study Materials
- Premium Notes interface
- Admissions / WhatsApp enquiry form
- Contact
- Responsive mobile navigation

## Important: Premium notes

The Premium section is currently a front-end interface only. A real paid-notes system needs:
1. Payment provider
2. User accounts/authentication
3. Server-side purchase verification
4. Protected file storage/download authorization
5. Admin area for uploading notes

Do not put paid PDF links directly in this static site, because anyone who can view the page source could access them.

## Cloudflare Pages

This is a framework-free static site. With Cloudflare Pages Git integration:
- connect the GitHub repository
- production branch: `main`
- build command: leave blank
- output directory: repository root

Cloudflare Pages can automatically deploy future commits.